title: Case Manager › Active cases › Quick view of a case
route: /manager
intro: A tracker row opens a right-hand quick view: the summary first (what is due next, units or days used and left, the approved window, level of care, payer, site, approval chance, the next review, documents and the three newest lines of history), then 'Open case' and, where it applies, 'Draft review' or 'Open review'. The case page is one button away. The row's own case ID and 'Open' button still go straight to the case.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Tracker row is on screen"
click c1 "Click the row (any part that is not a button)"
click c2 "Click the small quick view button 'Quick view of R-0988' at the end of the row\n(Tab to it, then Enter or Space)"
overlay ov "Right-hand panel 'R-0988 · Beacon'\nSubtitle 'D.L., 41 · Residential 3.5 · Continued stay 3', status pill at the right\nBig line 'Next due': 'Review due in 3 h', red when urgent, and one sentence on what to do next"
process pf "Focus goes to 'Open case'\nTab stays inside the panel"
screen kv "Facts, one line each\nUnits or days: '10 of 21 days used, 11 left' with a bar, and 'Runs out before review' when it applies\nApproved window: 'Sat 10/10 to Sat 10/31'\nLevel of care, Payer, Site ('Site A · Main campus')\nApproval chance with its band and range, and how many similar decisions"
screen kr "Next review: 'Review 3, Tue 10/20, 4:00 pm' with its pill (Not drafted yet, Drafted, Needs your update)\nA case not approved yet says 'Not approved yet' and 'None until the request is approved'"
decision dd "Does the case have a case page of its own (a request in the queue or on the Dashboard)?"
screen dc "Documents: 'Complete, all 9 in the packet' or '8 of 9. Missing: Therapy note from the last 14 days'\nCounted the way the case page counts them"
process dn "No Documents line: the ledger has no document list for the case"
screen hh "Latest history: the three newest lines that happened, each with who did it (a person or a named agent) and the time\nA case that is also a request shows the request's own events"

decision dr "What state is the next review in?"
click cd "Click 'Draft review'"
agent ag "Cadence drafts the review (demo: simulated, about 1.3 seconds)\nA paused Cadence says so at once: toast 'Cadence is paused in Settings'"
toast tg "'Cadence drafted 1 review'"
process pu "The panel updates in place: the pill reads 'Drafted' and 'Draft review' becomes 'Open review'"
click co "Click 'Open review'"
overlay rv "The review drawer opens on top of the quick view"
goto g3 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › The review drawer"
process pn2 "No review button: the next review is not due this week, or the case is not approved"

click cc "Click 'Open case'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases › Open a case from the tracker"
click cx "Press Escape, click X or the dimmed area"
process px "Escape closes one layer at a time: the review drawer first, then the quick view\nFocus returns to the quick view button of that row"
process ps "The panel shows only cases at the sites in view\nIf the view changes so the case is out of site, the panel closes"
end e1 "Back on the tracker"

s1 --> c1 --> ov
s1 --> c2 --> ov
ov --> pf --> kv --> kr --> dd
dd -->|Yes| dc --> hh
dd -->|No| dn --> hh
hh --> dr
dr -->|Not drafted yet, due this week| cd --> ag --> tg --> pu --> co
dr -->|Drafted or needs your update| co
dr -->|None, or later than this week| pn2
co --> rv --> g3
ov --> cc --> g1
ov --> cx --> px --> e1
ov -.-> ps
